              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Golden? (طلایی, talâyi.) Round? (گرد, gerd.) Kind? (مهربان, mehrabân.) Simple? (ساده, sâde.) Calm? (آرام, ârâm.) Tired? (خسته, khaste.) Silent? (ساکت, sâkat.) Glad? (شاد, shâd.) Wise? (دانا, dânâ.) Ignorant? (نادان, nâdân.) Healthy? (سالم, sâlem.) Coarse? (درشت, dorosht.) Tiny? (ریز, riz.) Little? (کم, kam.) Much? (زیاد, ziyâd.) Popular? (محبوب, mahbub.) To pay? (پرداختن, pardâkhtan.) To learn? (آموختن, âmukhtan.) To jump? (پریدن, paridan.) To fall? (افتادن, oftâdan.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
