            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To break? (شکستن, shekastan.) To sew? (دوختن, dukhtan.) To pull; to draw? (کشیدن, keshidan.) To pour? (ریختن, rikhtan.) To burn? (سوختن, sukhtan.) To plant? (کاشتن, kâshtan.) To pick? (چیدن, chidan.) To turn? (پیچیدن, pichidan.) To arrive? (رسیدن, residan.) To weep? (گریستن, geristan.) To hit? (زدن, zadan.) To be afraid? (ترسیدن, tarsidan.) To taste? (چشیدن, chashidan.) To smell? (بوییدن, buyidan.) To dig? (کندن, kandan.) To drive? (راندن, rândan.) To stay? (ماندن, mândan.) To live? (زیستن, zistan.) To stick? (چسباندن, chaspândan.) To spin? (چرخیدن, charkhidan.)"
